Wyzowl Video Studio: notices for the guides

The guides in this folder are Video Studio's own, written in its own words. Parts of them were written from the
sources below: their know-how was read, rewritten, trimmed to what works with HyperFrames 0.8.149 and merged with
Video Studio's own guidance. No source file is copied as it is. Each guide ends with a "Sources" line naming what it
came from and saying that it was changed. The parts that came from these sources keep their sources' licences, which
are reproduced below; the rest of Video Studio is under its own licence (LICENSE, one folder up).

